+// The app's 听书 experiments: with nothing else being spoken on the
+// handle, speaks `text` alone, then as 2 and 4 copies at once (up to
+// max_batch), and compares every frame's codes and c0 logits with the
+// lone run's; decodes the lone run's codes on 1, 2 and 4 codec lanes and
+// compares the audio; with `profile`, times every node of the talker,
+// predictor and codec graphs. `greedy` takes the most likely code
+// everywhere, so that only the arithmetic tells two runs apart. The
+// report goes to report_path. 0 when it ran.
+QT_API int qt_diag(struct qt_context * q, const char * text, const char * speaker, int frames, int greedy,
+                   int profile, const char * report_path);
